  <AbilityDef ParentName="CVG_TechniquePassiveBase">
    <defName>CVG_Tech_EdgeOfTheHeart</defName>
    <label>edge of the heart</label>
    <description>A sword cultivator does not swing a blade: the heart is the blade and the hand only follows. The Golden Edge disciples of Jiuxiao trained by cutting falling leaves with their eyes closed.\n\nPassive: melee hit chance +2 and melee damage +6% (more with realm and mastery).</description>
